      "content": "i know, i know. people say that. \"it gets better\" or whatever. but how? everything i tried to do to make things right just backfired and left me hollow. it feels like the more you fight, the more the world just pushes back until you're nothing. i'm just so exhausted from trying to exist in a world that's this broken. it's like fighting a tidal wave with a spoon. what's even the point of trying to keep going when the outcome is always the same?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
